    "macOS may show the keychain prompt twice. Please choose Always Allow both times. Choosing Deny or Cancel deletes nothing, and the app will not ask again until you restart it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS may show the keychain prompt twice. Please choose Always Allow both times. Choosing Deny or Cancel deletes nothing, and the app will not ask again until you restart it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 可能连续弹出两次钥匙串授权窗口，请两次都选择「始终允许」。选择「拒绝」或「取消」不会删除任何数据，且在重启 App 前不会再次询问。"
          }
        }
      }
